    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been having this really annoying burning sensation when i pee and just constant pressure down low. i'm pretty sure it's a UTI but i really don't want to take antibiotics if i can help it... they always mess up my stomach. do u think taking a really high dose of oregano oil capsules or maybe concentrated cranberry extract would be enough to clear it out before it gets worse?",
