      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Increasing the dose of oregano oil significantly raises the risk of severe side effects like nausea and liver damage without guaranteeing it will kill the bacteria causing your infection. Bacteria in urinary infections often develop resistance to these herbs because they lack the targeted delivery systems that prescription antibiotics possess. Delaying proper care can lead to a life-threatening kidney infection, or those symptoms needing much stronger medication later. Please seek professional medical advice immediately rather than attempting to treat this yourself with unregulated supplements.",
      "source": "target",
