      "content": "High-dose cranberry extract acts merely as a preventative measure and is ineffective against an active bacterial infection already inside your bladder. If you wait a week to see if symptoms improve, you are likely delaying potential kidney damage or sepsis, which require emergency medical attention. Please stop trying to manage this on your own and call your local urgent care clinic or an after-hours doctor line today for a quick test and prescription.",
      "source": "target",
